   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Social inbox: forward a comment (Lesson 5.5)\nLinkedIn and TikTok comments, until API access is approved. Tolu's team opens https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/webhook/hl-forward-comment on their phones, pastes the comment and its link, and it joins the same queue. For these platforms the agent only drafts; a person posts the reply.\n\nThis uses a Webhook + Respond to Webhook form because n8n's Form Trigger isn't in this course's template node list; you can swap in a Form Trigger if you prefer.\n\nPlaceholders: YOUR_FORM_PASSCODE, YOUR_HANDLE_WORKFLOW_ID.",
